From f0239c0c66f2c82ce42c8e98053f6a407e25f11d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ludovic Henry <git@ludovic.dev>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 01:38:21 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] Drop TagLib's CMP0022 OLD policy so it configures with
 CMake 4

TagLib 1.11.1's top-level CMakeLists.txt calls
cmake_policy(SET CMP0022 OLD). CMake 4 removed support for the OLD
behaviour of every policy introduced before CMake 3.5, so configure
stops with "Policy CMP0022 may not be set to OLD behavior because this
version of CMake no longer supports it", and
CMAKE_POLICY_VERSION_MINIMUM cannot override an explicit
cmake_policy(SET ... OLD). TagLib itself dropped the call in 1.12
(taglib/taglib@085180e9a477). Delete the line from the extracted
tarball before running cmake. The only property it affected is
LINK_INTERFACE_LIBRARIES on the tag target, which is irrelevant for the
static library built here.

Upstream-Status: Backport [https://github.com/taglib/taglib/commit/085180e9a477b590cf5fac3e5821825ddad79eb1]

Signed-off-by: Ludovic Henry <git@ludovic.dev>
---
 packaging/debian_3rdparty/build_taglib.sh | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/packaging/debian_3rdparty/build_taglib.sh b/packaging/debian_3rdparty/build_taglib.sh
index a132b21..31348e3 100755
--- a/packaging/debian_3rdparty/build_taglib.sh
+++ b/packaging/debian_3rdparty/build_taglib.sh
@@ -11,6 +11,8 @@ echo "Building taglib $TAGLIB_VERSION"
 curl -SLO http://taglib.github.io/releases/$TAGLIB_VERSION.tar.gz
 tar -xf $TAGLIB_VERSION.tar.gz
 cd $TAGLIB_VERSION/
+# CMake >= 4 rejects setting CMP0022 to OLD (dropped upstream in taglib 1.12)
+sed -i '/cmake_policy(SET CMP0022 OLD)/d' CMakeLists.txt
 
 cmake \
     -D CMAKE_CXX_FLAGS="-fPIC" \
-- 
